<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">A motivação e o engajamento da equipe são o combustível para transformar o planejamento em ação.</p>

<h2 class="zw-paragraph heading4" data-header="4" data-margin-bottom="15.96pt" data-margin-top="15.96pt" data-hd-info="4" data-line-height="1.2">Passo 6: Medição e Ajustes – O Planejamento Vivo<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_9awfnx9gb31h&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocyflmohlg8cus&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_9awfnx9gb31h"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_9awfnx9gb31h&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocyflmohlg8cus&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_9awfnx9gb31h"> </span></h2>
<p class="zw-paragraph heading0" data-header="0" data-textformat="{&quot;size&quot;:&quot;12.00&quot;,&quot;fgc&quot;:&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;}" data-margin-bottom="12pt" data-margin-top="12pt" data-hd-info="0" data-line-height="1.2">O planejamento estratégico para 2025 não é um documento estático. Ele deve ser revisado regularmente para se ajustar às mudanças do mercado e às novas prioridades.</p>

<h3 class="zw-paragraph heading5" data-header="5" data-margin-bottom="16.63pt" data-margin-top="16.63pt" data-hd-info="5" data-line-height="1.2" data-writer-border-info="{&quot;border-sides&quot;:[&quot;border-top&quot;,&quot;border-right&quot;,&quot;border-left&quot;,&quot;border-bottom&quot;]}">Práticas para Monitorar e Ajustar o Planejamento:<span data-range-char-type="start" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_v5qpvjtgyp2h&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocxhp7xwfvfdy6&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_v5qpvjtgyp2h"> </span><span data-range-char-type="end" data-bookmark-info="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;bookmark&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;toc_v5qpvjtgyp2h&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;_Tocxhp7xwfvfdy6&quot;}" data-bookmark-id="toc_v5qpvjtgyp2h"> </span></h3>
<ul data-list-id="85835153" data-list-format="{&quot;level0&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:6,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level1&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:7,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level2&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:8,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level3&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:6,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level4&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:7,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level5&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:8,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level6&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:6,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level7&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:7,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1},&quot;level8&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:8,&quot;startsWith&quot;:1}}" data-spl-bullet-format="{}">
